# JackMoebius — End-User License Agreement

**Effective date:** 10 July 2026
**Licensor:** Éric Bavu, France ("Licensor")
**Support:** <https://github.com/zinc75/JackMoebius/discussions>
**Software:** **JackMoebius** — the product name used to identify the Software —
  is a macOS CoreAudio↔JACK bridge comprising the AudioServerPlugIn driver
  (`JackMoebius.driver`), the `jackmoebiusd` daemon, the `jackmoebius` CLI,
  their installer, documentation, and any updates (the "Software").

